{"id":"H6404","lemma":"פֶּ֫לֶט","transliteration":"pelet","sayIt":"pe-let","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Pelet","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.2.47;\nson of Caleb (H3612H) and Jahdai (H3056);\nbrother of: Regem (H7276), Jotham (H3147I), Geshan (H1529), Ephah (H5891I) and Shaaph (H8174)\n§ Pelet = \"deliverance\"\n1) son of Jahdai and a descendant of Caleb\n2) son of Azmaveth and one of David's mighty warriors who joined him at Ziklag","glosses":["pelet"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":47,"renderings":{"bsb":"Pelet","kjv":"and Pelet"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-12","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Pelet","kjv":"and Pelet"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:47","note":"The sons of Jahdai: Regem, Jothan, Geshan, Pelet, Ephah, and Shaaph.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1529","lemma":"גֵּישָׁן","transliteration":"geshan","gloss":"Geshan"},{"id":"H3056","lemma":"יַהְדַּי","transliteration":"yehday","gloss":"Jahdai"},{"id":"H3147","lemma":"יוֹתָם","transliteration":"yotam","gloss":"Jotham"},{"id":"H3149","lemma":"יְזִיאֵל","transliteration":"yezavel","gloss":"Jeziel"},{"id":"H5820","lemma":"עַזְמָ֫וֶת","transliteration":"azmavet","gloss":"Azmaveth"},{"id":"H5891","lemma":"עֵיפָה","transliteration":"ephah","gloss":"Ephah"},{"id":"H7276","lemma":"רֶ֫גֶם","transliteration":"regem","gloss":"Regem"},{"id":"H8174","lemma":"שַׁ֫עַף","transliteration":"shaaph","gloss":"Shaaph"}],"senses":[{"id":"H6404H","gloss":"Pelet","relation":"H6404H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}